      "description": "Vacant academic positions at UiO - University of Oslo Jump to main content Norwegian This webpage uses cookies Some cookies are necessary to maintain operations on the website and are therefore not optional. Other cookies are necessary to gather statistics so that we can improve and develop the website further. These cookies are optional. You can withdraw your consent at any time. Accept Deny Read more about cookies UiO University of Oslo No En Menu For employees My studies Search our webpages Search Home Research Studies Student life Services and tools About UiO People For employees My studies Sub menu About UiO Vacancies at UiO Vacant academic positions at UiO Vacant administrative and technical positions at UiO About UiO > Vacancies at UiO > Vacant academic positions at UiO Norwegian version of this page Vacant academic positions at UiO We offer our academic staff professional challenges in a dynamic and internationally oriented environment. Researchers at all levels shall be able to unfold and develop their talent in a professionally run organisation. Join UiO as a researcher! Working at UiO Researcher training at UiO Appointment process for academic positions Our International Staff Mobility Office offers relocation support Contact Do you have questions about a position or are you stuck in the application portal? See who can help you Vacancies sorted by unit Faculty of Educational Sciences Faculty of Dentistry Faculty of Humanities Faculty of Law Faculty of Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty of Medicine Faculty of Social Sciences Faculty of Theology Centre for Global Sustainability Natural History Museum Museum of Cultural History Centre for Development and the Environment Centre for Gender Research International Summer School (ISS) University Library (Norwegian) Vacancies sorted by position title Associate Professor in Media and Communication Department: Department of Media and Communication Faculty: Faculty of Humanities Languages: